export declare const SERVER_INSTRUCTIONS = "Read-only tools for the Spurvik SDK and EU AI Act Article 50. Seven tools run locally and do not use the network. spurvik_scan_live_url sends one public URL to console.spurvik.com and reads the scan result, spurvik_batch_scan_domains does the same for up to 10 public domains, and spurvik_check_image_c2pa_url sends one public https image URL to console.spurvik.com for a read-only C2PA manifest check; localhost, private IPs and internal hosts are refused before any request. The SDK logs AI calls and attaches HMAC receipts. Marking hooks are the caller's. Spurvik does not mark content. spurvik_classify_ai_act_risk is an engineering mapping aid, not legal advice and not a decision under Article 6. spurvik_vendor_questionnaire_answers drafts copy-paste answers to the five EU AI Act questions in enterprise vendor security questionnaires and DPO RFPs.";
