export declare const VQ_DESCRIPTION = "Zero-network, deterministic Markdown answers to the five EU AI Act questions enterprise buyers ask in vendor security questionnaires and DPO RFPs: Q1 Art. 50(1) notice and 2 Dec 2026 Art. 50(2) provenance, Q2 Art. 12 cryptographic event logging (keyed HMAC-SHA256 inputHash/outputHash, SHA-256 recordHash chained by prevLogHash), Q3 GDPR Art. 5(1)(c) zero-prompt minimisation and EU Frankfurt residency, Q4 Art. 14 deterministic human approval gates, Q5 audit retention, DPO evidence and Annex IV documentation. Answers match the chosen Spurvik plan: Free \u20AC0 (10,000 events/mo, 30 days), Pro \u20AC19/mo (250,000, 90 days, white-label badge, hosted approval queue, DPO engineering summary), Team \u20AC79/mo (2,000,000, 12 months, Annex IV draft, webhook export) or Done-For-You \u20AC199 once (24h install, signed DPO readiness report, 1 year of Pro). Every field is optional. Ends with links to the interactive questionnaire and signup. Review the wording against your own setup before you send it.";
